cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Chart-er, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Chart-er"
abstract: >-
  A tabular dataset and a sentence in; a Vega-Lite chart, and the full record
  of how it was produced, out. Built for archaeologists who work in
  spreadsheets: period columns are ordered chronologically from PeriodO, the
  language model is the user's own, and every revision is stored with the
  exact request and response that produced it.
authors:
